      "content": "thanks. i'm also getting some feedback from my advisor about wanting to keep the curriculum inclusive of different frameworks. some people argue that focusing solely on structural drivers ignores the role of individual agency or economic factors like market trends and education levels. how should i address those viewpoints in the guide without undermining the main lesson on systemic barriers?",
